**/*.shade.typeshade.ts
# TypeShade entry/parameter decorators extend the TypeScript parser grammar. The glob selects every
# kernel file under src/: in src/gpu/ and in the gpu/ subdirectories (docs/library-structure.md,
# section 3.1).
src/**/*.shade.ts
# These two kernel files hold no decorator, and format:check checks them (the same document,
# section 2, "The glob", and section 4, rule 1). The lines name no directory, so the two stay
# checked when they move. epipolar.shade.ts holds `@inout` parameters since the pin f149b403
# (section 5, "The pin bump to `f149b403`"), so the glob leaves it out.
!src/**/numerics.shade.ts
!src/**/projective.shade.ts
